{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お届けものでーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろＢＬＴは届いてますか＼^^／\n引きはどうでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が出てしまった方には\n申し訳ない。\nですが\nレートが低くても\nサイン入りの９枚は\n破棄しないでいただきたいです。\n切実にお願いしますヽ(；；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ今日は！\n初めて生放送＆ラジオ\nやってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい…。\nはい…。\nもっとがんばりますね…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメありがとうございます！\n全部読んでますよ｀・ω・´"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆーわけで\n「「答えちゃうお( ゜_ゝ゜)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多くあった質問にしぼらせてもらったり\n諸事情により答えられないものがあり\nほんとに申し訳ないです＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画は読む？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n読みますよー！\n君に届け、スイッチガール\nワンピース、などなど好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB49も読んでましたｗ\n友達に借りてですけどね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにかおすすめありすか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/penguin.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝強い？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒\nたぶん強い方だと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎朝起こしますよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(照)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこの辺